email.workspace_suspended.body:
Outbound email sending for your sphericon workspace {{.Workspace}} has been suspended.

Reason: {{.Reason}}
Set by: {{.Actor}}

Nothing is lost: scheduled broadcasts and automations pause and resume when the suspension is lifted. You can still sign in and view your data. {{if .Support}}To appeal, email {{.Support}}.{{else}}To appeal, contact your sphericon administrator.{{end}}

email.webhook_disabled.body:
sphericon stopped sending events to the webhook endpoint {{.URL}} in your workspace {{.Workspace}}.

{{.Reason}}

Nothing else changed. Fix the receiver, then enable the endpoint again in the workspace settings: its failure history is cleared when you do.
